# Per-Dockerfile ignore (BuildKit). The build context is TrafficCapture/, which contains the whole
# Java tree; without this the context transfer ships gigabytes of Gradle output and the Cargo
# target directory into the daemon. Keep only what the image build reads.
*
!captureProtobufs/src/main/proto/
!captureProxy/
captureProxy/target/
captureProxy/qualification/
captureProxy/Dockerfile
captureProxy/Dockerfile.dockerignore
